    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdc771e8e7eb66ca",
      "translationZh": "Databricks 上的 Grok | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63c8556430495ae3",
      "translationZh": "Grok 模型现已在 Databricks Agent Bricks 上推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e007fd0c31fd8d8f",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴地宣布，Grok 模型现已原生接入 Databricks 的开发者智能体平台 Databricks Agent Bricks。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cd654cad8e58cc9",
      "translationZh": "作为 Databricks 2026 Data + AI Summit 的一部分，Databricks 正与 SpaceXAI 合作，将 Grok 与其他前沿模型及开源模型一同引入一个统一、受治理的平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d02acf4d358b12ca",
      "translationZh": "Agent Bricks 将上下文（源自 Lakehouse 中的数据）与控制权和选择权相结合，使工程团队能够有效构建处理海量数据的 AI 智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7827a9d6ca4ac728",
      "translationZh": "加上 Amazon Bedrock 上的 Grok，企业有了更多方式，可以在数据现有的存储环境中运行 SpaceXAI 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7969fa8882f6f3e6",
      "translationZh": "有关 Agent Bricks 的更多信息，请参阅 Databricks 的公告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
